+## Multi-GPU SFT with QLoRA and FSDP
+QLoRA can also be combined with FSDP. Set `bnb_4bit_quant_storage` to a half or full precision dtype (for example `bfloat16`) so the 4-bit weights can be sharded, and pass the matching `torch_dtype` when loading the model. The launch command is available at [run_peft_qlora_fsdp.sh](https://github.com/huggingface/peft/blob/main/examples/sft/run_peft_qlora_fsdp.sh) with its config at [fsdp_config_qlora.yaml](https://github.com/huggingface/peft/blob/main/examples/sft/configs/fsdp_config_qlora.yaml).
+
+## Multi-GPU SFT with QLoRA and DeepSpeed ZeRO-3
+QLoRA can also be combined with DeepSpeed ZeRO-3. Set `bnb_4bit_quant_storage` to a half or full precision dtype (for example `bfloat16`) so the 4-bit weights can be sharded, and pass the matching `torch_dtype` when loading the model. The launch command is available at [run_peft_qlora_deepspeed_stage3.sh](https://github.com/huggingface/peft/blob/main/examples/sft/run_peft_qlora_deepspeed_stage3.sh) with its config at [deepspeed_config_z3_qlora.yaml](https://github.com/huggingface/peft/blob/main/examples/sft/configs/deepspeed_config_z3_qlora.yaml).
